UniDirStat treemap row layout

The row-packing algorithm in src/layout.rs is a Rust adaptation of
ArrangeRows in WinDirStat's windirstat/Controls/TreeMapLayout.cpp.
The extension color assignment and palette in src/file_colors.rs follow
WinDirStatModel.cpp and Controls/TreeMap.h / Controls/TreeMap.cpp.

