Adaptation: 2026-10-16, with continuous proportional coordinates,
cancellable traversal and color-grouped tiny-file regions.
Equal-byte extension ties use deterministic name ordering. File colors
retain the global logical-byte ranking when changing folder or metric;
the modern flat rendering does not reproduce cushion shading.

